@ChoyERP.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Login
POST {{ChoyERP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@choy.local",
  "password": "Choy.Admin#2026"
}

### Usuario autenticado
GET {{ChoyERP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Clientes
GET {{ChoyERP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=name
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Crear cliente
POST {{ChoyERP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cliente de Prueba",
  "legalName": "Cliente de Prueba S.A.C.",
  "taxId": "20111111111",
  "contactName": "Contacto",
  "email": "contacto@cliente.local",
  "phone": "014444444"
}

### Roles
GET {{ChoyERP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Permisos
GET {{ChoyERP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
